# Edit Node changes the text, type, parent, start date, star, flag and tags from the keyboard and Enter saves them.
file <<END
Work:
	- Draft plan @x(1)
Home:
END
keys j e
see Edit Node
type  now
keys <C-t>
see Note
keys <C-t> <C-t> <Tab> <Tab> <Tab>
type home
keys <Enter>
see Home
keys <Tab>
type 2026-11-02
keys <Enter> <Tab> <Tab>
type *
keys <Tab>
type !
keys <Tab> <Del>
type ctx(phone)
keys <Enter> <S-Tab> <Up>
see @ctx(phone)
keys <Enter>
hide Edit Node
quit
saved <<END
Work:
Home:
	- Draft plan now @start(2026-11-02) @star @flag @ctx(phone)
END
